############################################################
# THE BOUNDARY SET: a latent defect in the check being folded in.
#
# addr_align.py matched '^[0-9a-f]{8}:	' and counted 425,871 starts.
# check_table.py requires a THIRD tab-separated field (the mnemonic) and
# counts 424,232. The 1,639-line difference is objdump's BYTE-CONTINUATION
# lines for instructions longer than 7 bytes, e.g.
#     10b6276b:<TAB>63 c4 10
# which is the tail of the 10-byte 'mov ds:0x10c46330,0x10c46334' at
# 0x10b62764. addr_align.py would have called an address landing there
# ALIGNED. It is mid-instruction.
#
# DID IT MATTER? No: NONE of the 24 original addresses landed on a
# continuation line, so #3721's set of eight is unaffected and stands.
# Reported because the next table it grades may not be so lucky.
############################################################
